# The Renux installer in Spanish, for libbsddialog (contrib/bsddialog/lib/
# renux_tr.c), which reads it from RENUX_LANG_TABLE: the dialogs of the
# programs that use the library (bsdinstall's partedit and distextract,
# tzsetup) and its own texts (buttons, states, the calendar).  An English
# text, a tab, its translation; \n is a newline, %s any text.
#
# Buttons share one width, the longest label's: the partition editor's six
# (Create ... Finish) fit 80 columns with labels of up to 9 letters, and
# where they do not, partedit asks for its menu again and again.
#
# Buttons share one width, the longest label's: the partition editor's six
# (Create ... Finish) fit 80 columns with labels of up to 9 letters, and
# where they do not, partedit asks for its menu again and again.
